        },
        {
          "text": "Eh’ ico nabonye kibereye kandi c’igikundiro: n’umuntu kurya akanywa, akanezererwa ivyiza bivuye mu butame bgiwe bgose, ubg’ atamira musi y’izuba, imisi yose y’ukubaho kwiwe, iyo Imana yamuhaye: kukw ivyo ari vyo mugabane wiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
